  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "EMOTIONAL ROAD\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 13, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Where this character is on their road\n   2 Where the film is on its road\n   3 Does the feeling turn\n   4 Hidden to shown\n   5 How far the feeling spreads\n   6 Catharsis\n   7 Feeling held in\n   8 Hope\n   9 What they stand to lose\n  10 Breather\n  11 False high, false low\n  12 Two roads\n  13 A feeling comes back\n  14 Warmth between two\n  15 Dread\n  16 On their side, or against them\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 13, CC 65 to 80\n   1 Nostalgia\n   2 Longing\n   3 Guilt\n   4 Earned tears\n   5 Cool or warm telling\n   6 Feeling left when the film ends\n   7 Grief\n   8 Loneliness\n   9 Betrayal\n  10 Forgiveness\n  11 Resentment\n  12 All seems lost\n  13 The calm before the storm\n  14 A small win to hold on to\n  15 We already know it ends badly\n  16 The moment we're all waiting for\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 13, CC 81 to 96\n   1 suite: Emotional road lens\n   2 suite: Rock bottom\n   3 suite: Hope dies\n   4 suite: The midpoint win\n   5 suite: A rest stop\n   6 suite: Crossed roads\n   7 suite: The old song\n   8 suite: Slow dread\n   9 suite: Everything to lose\n  10 suite: Earned release\n  11 suite: Tearjerker finale\n  12 suite: Slow-burn grudge\n  13 suite: Bittersweet ending\n  14 suite: Cold and distant\n  15 suite: Lonely heart\n  16 suite: A guilty conscience\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 13, CC 97 to 112\n   1 suite: Stab in the back\n   2 suite: Making peace\n   3 suite: Rose-tinted past\n   4 suite: Rooting for the wrong one\n   5 suite: Back from the bottom\n   6 suite: The long-awaited meeting\n   7 suite: Slow-burn dread\n   8 pair: When a character reaches their lowest point, their feeling turns\n   9 pair: After a low scene, a laugh\n  10 pair: A hidden feeling bursts out later\n  11 pair: After tension peaks, release follows\n  12 pair: When enough feeling is held in, it comes out\n  13 pair: When a false high peaks, the fall follows\n  14 pair: When a big feeling peaks, a breather follows\n  15 pair: When the stakes rise, hope gets fragile\n  16 pair: When hope is lost, the release comes later\nCV-CC 5: MIDI channel 14, CC 1 to 16\n   1 pair: When an old feeling comes back changed, the release arrives\n   2 pair: When dread builds, the music thins out\n   3 pair: When the warmth cools, the two roads part\n   4 pair: When the dread is lifted, a laugh comes\n   5 pair: When dread builds, a character's attention starts narrowing\n   6 pair: When we feel with them, their tears feel earned\n   7 pair: When we turn against them, we stop feeling with them\n   8 pair: When they show gentle care, we take their side\n   9 pair: When an old tune returns, nostalgia comes with it\n  10 pair: When nostalgia rises, the color warms\n  11 pair: When the past calls, longing grows\n  12 pair: When longing grows, loneliness follows\n  13 pair: When loneliness grows, the frame empties around them\n  14 pair: When loneliness grows, the music falls away\n  15 pair: When guilt grows, they hold more in\n  16 pair: When guilt grows, words stop matching meaning\nCV-CC 6: MIDI channel 14, CC 17 to 32\n   1 pair: When jealousy lingers, it hardens into a grudge\n   2 pair: When the tears are earned, the release arrives\n   3 pair: When the telling turns ice cold, we feel less with them\n   4 pair: When the telling warms, the camera moves closer\n   5 pair: When the big release comes, the ending stays with us\n   6 pair: When an old feeling comes back, the ending lingers longer\n   7 pair: When hope is lost, grief sets in\n   8 pair: When grief is heavy, a laugh slips in\n   9 pair: When they are betrayed, the warmth goes cold\n  10 pair: When they are betrayed, a grudge takes root\n  11 pair: When the grudge nears boiling, anger breaks out\n  12 pair: When they forgive, the warmth comes back\n  13 pair: When they forgive, the big release comes\n  14 pair: When hope comes back, the picture softens\n  15 pair: When dread runs high, the colors start to go wrong\n  16 pair: When grief gets heavier, the rain comes to the window\nCV-CC 7: MIDI channel 14, CC 33 to 48\n   1 pair: When the calm before the storm lasts longer, the sky turns harder\n   2 pair: When a feeling comes back, the memory shows over the present\n   3 pair: When all seems lost, hope drops\n   4 pair: When they hit the bottom, a small win comes next\n   5 pair: When the small win matters more, hope rises\n   6 pair: When only the audience knows the storm is coming, dread rises\n   7 pair: When the calm lasts longer, tenderness grows\n   8 pair: When we are surer it ends badly, the tears are earned\n   9 pair: When the happy moments come before a known bad end, our feelings get mixed\n  10 pair: When the moment is held back longer, hope builds\n  11 pair: When the moment finally comes and beats our hopes, relief floods in\n  12 pair: When the audience knows the danger first, every calm line adds dread\n  13 pair: When someone leaves home for good, the house goes lonely\n  14 pair: When they argue, they warm to each other\n  15 pair: When a mix-up pulls them apart, the longing grows\n  16 pair: When summer turns to autumn, the longing sets in\nCV-CC 8: MIDI channel 14, CC 49 to 64\n   1 pair: When their shame is seen by others, the resentment boils\n   2 pair: When a small win comes after many losses, the relief is huge\n   3 pair: When nobody shows a feeling, the loneliness shows through\n   4 pair: When dawn comes, the friends finally say what they mean\n   5 pairs: Emotional rollercoaster\n   6 pairs: The dam breaks\n   7 pairs: The fall and the rise\n   8 pairs: Rest after a big feeling\n   9 pairs: The pressure cooker\n  10 pairs: From loss to letting go\n  11 pairs: Betrayed, then forgiven\n  12 pairs: Getting it off their chest\n  13 pairs: The ache of missing\n  14 pairs: Earning the tears\n  15 pairs: The climb back\n  16 pairs: Slow-burn dread: the moves"
   },
